          style={
            {
              "fontFamily": "Menlo",
            }
          }
        >
          <Text>
            parse_blocks
          </Text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
           function doesn't actually embed dynamic blocks contents. To get a complete HTML snippet you would have to also call 
        </Text>
        <Text
          style={
            {
              "fontFamily": "Menlo",
            }
          }
        >
          <Text>
            render_block
          </Text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          . While 
        </Text>
        <Text
          style={
            {
              "fontFamily": "Menlo",
            }
          }
        >
          <Text>
            do_blocks
          </Text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
           combines both of them I stand against using it.
        </Text>
      </Text>
